text = "
			   Version Notes
_________________________

Sprint 2:

- Added basic level tiles
- Added a basic level scene for testing
- Made it so the “Start” button opens a test level
- Added player scene with basic movement (walk, jump, double jump)
- Added player sprites & animations (idle, run, wing jump)
- Added a basic, temporary player health bar
- Added basic pathfinding enemy scene which follows the player when they’re nearby
- Changed the credits to scroll slightly faster
_________________________

Sprint 1:

- Added WPI splash screen
- Added Main Menu scene
- Added \"Start\", \"Version History\", and \"Credits\" buttons
- Added scrollable Version History
- Added autoscrolling Credits
- Added main menu music

"
